  "description": "A pose search (motion matching) database over the locomotion clips: idle, walk and run, plus the locomotion blend space (disabled here, to show a source that stays listed but unindexed). It matches on both feet's position and velocity, the pelvis velocity, and the character's trajectory 0.2 s back and 0.2 and 0.5 s ahead; the cycle phase breaks ties. The index is built from this file and kept in the project's cache, never next to the source."
